DataBuck SDK License Notice

This repository does not grant an open-source license to the DataBuck SDK.
Use of the SDK requires a valid, signed databucksdk.properties file issued
for the customer. The SDK verifies the customer ID, issue date, expiry date,
and signature at import and before public SDK operations. The license remains
valid through its expiry date, inclusive.

The signed properties file is a technical license credential. This notice is
not a customer agreement or a grant of rights. Contact DataBuck for the
applicable license terms or a renewed credential.
